  "title": "United Bank Appoints Andrew Dawson as Market President of Wilmington Market",
  "summary": "WILMINGTON, NC – United Bank recently appointed Andrew Dawson as market president of its Wilmington Market. As market president, Dawson will lead strategic efforts to drive commercial and retail production, while ensuring the profitability and sustained growth of the market. Dawson will also play a pivotal leadership role in managing public relations efforts in Wilmington, while also representing United Bank in the community through active participation in civic affairs and professional organizations.",
